OL,3,GNEWSA'Community hub' kiosk could close
OL,4,Aamid 400% rent hike
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a "community hub" kiosk
OL,7,Ffears he could be forced to close amid
OL,8,Fa 400% increase in rent costs.
OL,10,FRaymon Daniel, who owns The Crepe &
OL,11,FCoffee Cabin on Prince Bridge in
OL,12,FBristol, said his fees have risen from
OL,13,F#1,400 to #7,000 a year and because the
OL,14,Fcouncil failed to carry out a review in
OL,15,F2025, he faces 22 months of backdated
OL,16,Fpayments.
OL,18,FDaniel said: "Nobody came [in 2025],
OL,19,Fnobody asked. It's a lot for a small
OL,20,Fbusiness."
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
