OL,3,GNEWSA'Community hub' kiosk could close
OL,4,Aamid 400% rent hike
OL,5,
OL,6,FBristol City Council said rent reviews
OL,7,Fare "understandably difficult
OL,8,Fconversations to have" and explained it
OL,9,Fhas paused the review process to have
OL,10,Ffurther discussions with Daniel.
